# Mixed-radix NTT only works for standard DFT (at equally-spaced roots).

# For our case: points[j] = zeta_97^{g_inv^j * cofactor}
# These are 97-th roots of unity in a SPECIFIC order (determined by g_inv).
# They are NOT 96-th roots of unity!

print()
print("    ISSUE: Step2Matrix points are 97-th roots of unity,")
print("    not 96-th roots of unity. Standard NTT decomposition")
print("    does not directly apply.")
